<table style="width:100%">
  <tr>
    <td style="color:#223388; font-size:150%; vertical-align:middle"><span style="color:black; font-weight:600">NIST Atomic Spectra Database Lines Data</span><p>
      <u>Be I</u>: 581 Lines of Data Found<br />
<span style="font-size:larger; font-weight:bold"><i>Z</i> = 4, Be isoelectronic sequence</span><span style="font-size=300%">&nbsp;</span></p>
    </td>
    <td style="text-align:right; vertical-align:middle">
<div class='ref'>
<b>Example of how to reference these results:</b><br />

Kramida,&nbsp;A., Ralchenko,&nbsp;Yu., Reader,&nbsp;J., and NIST ASD Team (2024).
  <i>NIST Atomic Spectra Database</i> (ver.&nbsp;5.12),
  [Online]. Available: <span style="color:#0000cc;">https://physics.nist.gov/asd</span>
  [2025, March 22].
  National Institute of Standards and Technology, Gaithersburg, MD.
    DOI: <span style="color:#0000cc;">https://doi.org/10.18434/T4W30F</span>
<br />
<div style="text-align: right; font-size: x-small">
<a href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popdef('/cgi-bin/ASD/bibtex.pl?y=2025&amp;m=March&amp;d=22');return true" target="_top">BibTex Citation</a> (new window)
</div>
</div>
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td colspan="2">&nbsp;</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td colspan="2" style="color:#655665; font-family: helvetica,arial; font-size:80%"><b><u><i>&lambda;</i> in</u>: <span style="color:darkred">vacuum</span> <span style="color:navy"></span><br />
<u>Highest relative intensity</u>: 45<br />
<span class="hnd">Some data for neutral and singly-charged ions are available in the <a href="/PhysRefData/Handbook/index.html" target="_new">Handbook of Basic Atomic Spectroscopic Data</a></span>
</b></td>
  </tr>
</table>

<p>
<table style="background-color:black; width:75%; border-spacing:1px" >
  <tr>
    <td colspan="3" style="color:white; font-size:10pt; width:70%; background-color:#224477; text-align:center">
      <b>Primary data sources</b>
    </td>
    <td rowspan="4">
    </td>
    <td style="white-space:nowrap; color:white; font-size:10pt; background-color:#446655; text-align:center">
      <table style="border:thin hidden;text-align:center;width:100%">
        <tr>
          <td style="text-align:center; white-space:nowrap">Query NIST Bibliographic Databases for</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="text-align:center"><b>Be  I</b> (new window)</td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td class='brt1'>
      Energy Levels:
    </td>
    <td class='bcn'>
      &nbsp;<a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Be I';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=el&amp;db_id=9172&amp;comment_code=&amp;element=Be&amp;spectr_charge=1&amp;type=E');return false">Kramida&nbsp;&&nbsp;Martin&nbsp;1997</a>, <a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Be I';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=el&amp;db_id=20591&amp;comment_code=&amp;element=Be&amp;spectr_charge=1&amp;type=E');return false">Cook&nbsp;et&nbsp;al.&nbsp;2018</a>, <a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Be I';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=el&amp;db_id=21345&amp;comment_code=&amp;element=Be&amp;spectr_charge=1&amp;type=E');return false">Cook&nbsp;et&nbsp;al.&nbsp;2020</a>&nbsp;
    </td>
    <td class='blf'>
      &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Energy levels have been re-optimized here to account for the high-precision measurements of Cook&nbsp;et&nbsp;al.&nbsp;2018,&nbsp;2020. The code <a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Be I';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=el&amp;db_id=15449&amp;comment_code=&amp;element=Be&amp;spectr_charge=1&amp;type=E');return false">LOPT (Kramida&nbsp;2011 </a>) was used for that. Uncertainties are given for excitation energies from the ground level. Additional digits have been preserved in the level values in order to reproduce observed wavelengths in several subsystems of transitions. The present data set was prepared by A.&nbsp;Kramida for the release of ASD v.5.8 in October, 2020, except for the energy of the 1s<sup>2</sup>2s9p <sup>1</sup>P&deg;<sub>1</sub> level. For this level, a typo in the value published in <a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Be I';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=el&amp;db_id=9172&amp;comment_code=&amp;element=Be&amp;spectr_charge=1&amp;type=E');return false">Kramida&nbsp;&&nbsp;Martin&nbsp;1997 </a> has been corrected by A.&nbsp;Kramida in November 2021 for the release of ASD v.5.10.
    </td>
    <td class='bcn1'>
      <a href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popbib('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/Elevbib/make_query.cgi?spectra=Be%20I&amp;method=EL&amp;method=TE&amp;method=ND&amp;method=IP&amp;method=SF&amp;method=QF&amp;order=1');return false"
        onmouseover="self.status='Be  I: bibliography energy levels query';return true;"
        onmouseout="self.status=''; return true;" target="_blank">Be  I Energy Levels</a>
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td class='brt1'>
      Lines:
    </td>
    <td class='bcn'>
      &nbsp;<a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Be I';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=el&amp;db_id=9172&amp;comment_code=&amp;element=Be&amp;spectr_charge=1&amp;type=L');return false">Kramida&nbsp;&&nbsp;Martin&nbsp;1997</a>, <a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Be I';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=el&amp;db_id=20591&amp;comment_code=&amp;element=Be&amp;spectr_charge=1&amp;type=L');return false">Cook&nbsp;et&nbsp;al.&nbsp;2018</a>, <a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Be I';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=el&amp;db_id=21345&amp;comment_code=&amp;element=Be&amp;spectr_charge=1&amp;type=L');return false">Cook&nbsp;et&nbsp;al.&nbsp;2020</a>&nbsp;
    </td>
    <td class='blf'>
      &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Uncertainties of the Ritz wavelengths have been determined in the level optimization procedure. The present data set was prepared by A.&nbsp;Kramida for the release of ASD v.5.8 in October, 2020.
    </td>
    <td class='bcn1'>
      <a href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popbib('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/Elevbib/make_query.cgi?spectra=Be%20I&amp;method=W&amp;method=CL&amp;order=1');return false"
        onmouseover="self.status='Be  I: bibliography wavelengths query';return true;"
        onmouseout="self.status=''; return true;" target="_blank">Be  I Line Wavelengths and Classification</a>
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td class='brt1'>
      Transition Probabilities:
    </td>
    <td class='bcn'>
      &nbsp;<a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Be I';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=tp&amp;db_id=8702&amp;comment_code=&amp;element=Be&amp;spectr_charge=1&amp;type=T');return false">Fuhr and Wiese 2010</a>&nbsp;
    </td>
    <td class='blf'>
      
    </td>
    <td class='bcn1'>
      <a href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popbib('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/Fvalbib/make_query.cgi?spectra=Be%20I&amp;order=1');return false"
        onmouseover="self.status='Be  I: bibliography transition probability query';return true;"
        onmouseout="self.status=''; return true;" target="_blank">Be  I Transition Probabilities</a>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>
